1. BRFL Bangladesh Pvt. Ltd. - No operations &lt;BR&gt; 
2. BRFL Italia SRL - Business Closed &lt;BR&gt; 
3. BRFL Italia Licenses SRL - Financials not available &lt;BR&gt; 
